<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>

<p dir="auto">This is some tweaks to the docs added in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5093056209" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45053" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/45053/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45053">#45053</a> as <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Elchi3/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Elchi3">@Elchi3</a> spotted some issues when reviewing the BCD changes.</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Add's <code class="notranslate">toJSON</code> methods. Note that <code class="notranslate">PerformanceSoftNavigation</code>'s <code class="notranslate">toJSON()</code> exists in Chrome's implementation but was missing from the spec (just added in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5257824975" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/WICG/soft-navigations/issues/91" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/WICG/soft-navigations/pull/91/hovercard" href="https://github.com/WICG/soft-navigations/pull/91">WICG/soft-navigations#91</a>) so is not yet in BCD.</li>
<li>Removed <code class="notranslate">navigationId</code> from <code class="notranslate">InteractionContentfulPaint</code> and <code class="notranslate">PerformanceSoftNavigation</code> and added it to <code class="notranslate">PerformanceEntry</code> instead as it's an inherited property.</li>
<li>Added to more docs.</li>
<li>Marked where Performance APIs and properties were experimental.</li>
<li>Added to the Performance SVG diagram and rejigged it a bit to correct some things. Not I also added the upcoming PerformanceContainerTiming while in there even though it's not yet documented elsewhere on MDN. Will add that to my todo list.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>

<p dir="auto">Correct docs.</p>
