        <title type="html"><![CDATA[RTCTransportStats integer props are non-negative]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45296</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45296"/>
        <updated>2026-08-24T07:08:22.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">This updates the IDL unsigned integer properties of RTCTransportStats to say that the value is a "<code class="notranslate">non-negative</code> integer" rather than a positive integer. The difference being that 0 is not positive (or negative).</p>
<p dir="auto">There are probably many other cases of this error in web API, sadly some added by me.</p>
<p dir="auto">This is an in-passing fix related to <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5170080646" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45185" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/45185/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45185">#45185</a></p>]]></content>
